---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us - Blast Robotics" description="Learn about FRC Team 10989 Blast Robotics — our mission to empower students through hands-on STEM education, FIRST Robotics Competition, and community engagement in Mainline PA.">
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="hero min-h-[60vh] bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/10 to-secondary/10">
    <div class="hero-content text-center">
      <div class="max-w-4xl">
        <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6">About FRC Team 10989</h1>
        <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-base-content/80">
          Providing opportunities for students to learn and grow through robotics, engineering, and community engagement.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission & Vision -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-base-100">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Our Mission</h2>
          <p class="text-lg text-base-content/70 mb-6">
            Empowering next generation of innovators through hands-on robotics experiences, fostering a passion for STEM, and building a community of learners.
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg text-base-content/70">
            We believe in the power of robotics to inspire creativity, teamwork, and problem-solving skills among students. Our mission is to provide a platform where students can explore their interests in technology and engineering while making a positive impact in their communities.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="card bg-primary text-primary-content shadow-xl">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h3 class="card-title text-2xl mb-4">Our Vision</h3>
            <p class="text-lg opacity-90">
              To be a team where students can explore and participate in the FIRST Robotics Competition and STEM education, inspiring them to become future leaders in technology and engineering.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Company Values -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-base-200">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">Our Values</h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-base-content/70 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          The principles that guide everything we do and shape our company culture.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- Value 1 -->
        <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl">
          <div class="card-body text-center">
            <div class="mx-auto w-16 h-16 bg-primary/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="card-title justify-center text-xl mb-2">Innovation</h3>
            <p class="text-base-content/70">
              Even though we are a new team, we are committed to pushing the boundaries of technology and creativity in robotics.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Value 2 -->
        <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl">
          <div class="card-body text-center">
            <div class="mx-auto w-16 h-16 bg-secondary/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-secondary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="card-title justify-center text-xl mb-2">Integrity</h3>
            <p class="text-base-content/70">
              We operate with transparency, honesty, and ethical practices in all our team operations.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Value 3 -->
        <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl">
          <div class="card-body text-center">
            <div class="mx-auto w-16 h-16 bg-accent/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="card-title justify-center text-xl mb-2">Excellence</h3>
            <p class="text-base-content/70">
              We strive for perfection in every project, delivering quality that exceeds expectations.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Value 4 -->
        <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl">
          <div class="card-body text-center">
            <div class="mx-auto w-16 h-16 bg-success/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-success" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zm6 3a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM7 10a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="card-title justify-center text-xl mb-2">Collaboration</h3>
            <p class="text-base-content/70">
              We believe in the power of teamwork and partnership to achieve extraordinary results.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Value 5 -->
        <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl">
          <div class="card-body text-center">
            <div class="mx-auto w-16 h-16 bg-warning/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-warning" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="card-title justify-center text-xl mb-2">Growth</h3>
            <p class="text-base-content/70">
              We are committed to continuous learning and development for our team and members.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Value 6 -->
        <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl">
          <div class="card-body text-center">
            <div class="mx-auto w-16 h-16 bg-info/10 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
              <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-info" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"></path>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="card-title justify-center text-xl mb-2">Inclusion</h3>
            <p class="text-base-content/70">
              We embrace diversity and create an inclusive environment where everyone feels valued and empowered.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What We Do: Technical Focus -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-base-100 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <span class="badge badge-outline badge-primary uppercase tracking-wide mb-4">Activities</span>
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">What We Do</h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-base-content/70 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Building competitive robots and developing critical STEM skills across multiple disciplines.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- 3 technical cards -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-6">
        <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl border border-base-300">
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 3v2m6-2v2M9 19v2m6-2v2M5 9H3m2 6H3m18-6h-2m2 6h-2M7 19h10a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2zM9 9h6v6H9V9z"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="card-title text-xl">Design & Build</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-base-content/70">
              Engineer competitive robots using CAD design (Onshape, Fusion 360, SolidWorks), machining, and advanced manufacturing techniques. Currently building a pre-season drivetrain with support from FRC 1168.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl border border-base-300">
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-secondary/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-secondary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="card-title text-xl">Programming & Controls</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-base-content/70">
              Develop control systems using Java, C++, and Python. Learn autonomous routines, path planning (A*, RRT, Dijkstra), sensor/vision integration, WPILib, and ROS basics.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card bg-base-100 shadow-xl border border-base-300">
          <div class="card-body">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-accent/10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-accent" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 7h6m0 10v-3m-3 3h.01M9 17h.01M9 14h.01M12 14h.01M15 11h.01M12 11h.01M9 11h.01M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <h3 class="card-title text-xl">Technical Skills</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-base-content/70">
              Master Mechanical Engineering (drivetrain/chassis design, gear ratios), Electrical Engineering (wiring, power distribution), Applied Physics (torque, friction), and Data Analytics (scouting systems).
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Beyond the Build Divider -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 my-14">
        <div class="flex-1 h-px bg-base-content/10"></div>
        <span class="badge badge-outline badge-primary uppercase tracking-wide text-sm px-4 py-3 whitespace-nowrap">Beyond the Build</span>
        <div class="flex-1 h-px bg-base-content/10"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Row 1: 2 wide cards -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8 mb-6">
        <div>
          <div class="about-bento-card h-full">
            <i class="bi bi-briefcase about-bento-icon text-primary" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <h3 class="about-bento-title">Business Administration</h3>
            <p class="about-bento-desc">
              Develop planning, organization, and leadership skills by coordinating projects, managing team operations, and supporting long-term goals.
            </p>
            <div class="about-bento-accent" style="background: hsl(var(--p));"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="about-bento-card h-full">
            <i class="bi bi-currency-dollar about-bento-icon text-success" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <h3 class="about-bento-title">Budget Tracking</h3>
            <p class="about-bento-desc">
              Build financial literacy by planning budgets, tracking expenses, managing resources, and supporting fundraising and sponsorship efforts.
            </p>
            <div class="about-bento-accent" style="background: hsl(var(--su));"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Bento Row 2: 3 smaller cards -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 md:gap-8 items-start">
        <div>
          <div class="about-bento-card h-full">
            <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-code about-bento-icon text-secondary" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <h3 class="about-bento-title">Technical Documentation & Portfolios</h3>
            <p class="about-bento-desc">
              Document designs, code, testing, and achievements to create clear technical records and professional engineering portfolios.
            </p>
            <div class="about-bento-accent" style="background: hsl(var(--s));"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="about-bento-card h-full">
            <i class="bi bi-megaphone about-bento-icon text-warning" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <h3 class="about-bento-title">Presentation & Public Speaking</h3>
            <p class="about-bento-desc">
              Strengthen confidence by presenting technical ideas to judges, sponsors, community members, and other teams.
            </p>
            <div class="about-bento-accent" style="background: hsl(var(--wa));"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="about-bento-card h-full">
            <i class="bi bi-diagram-3 about-bento-icon text-info" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <h3 class="about-bento-title">Communication & Networking</h3>
            <p class="about-bento-desc">
              Build professional relationships by collaborating with mentors, sponsors, community partners, and teams throughout the FIRST network.
            </p>
            <div class="about-bento-accent" style="background: hsl(var(--in));"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .about-bento-card {
      position: relative;
      background: hsl(var(--b2) / 0.6);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      border: 1px solid hsl(var(--bc) / 0.08);
      border-radius: 1.25rem;
      padding: 1.75rem;
      overflow: hidden;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
      transition: transform 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1),
                  box-shadow 0.25s ease,
                  border-color 0.25s ease;
    }
    .about-bento-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px) scale(1.01);
      box-shadow: 0 16px 40px hsl(var(--p) / 0.12);
      border-color: hsl(var(--bc) / 0.18);
    }
    .about-bento-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(
        120deg,
        transparent 0%,
        hsl(var(--bc) / 0.04) 40%,
        hsl(var(--bc) / 0.08) 50%,
        hsl(var(--bc) / 0.04) 60%,
        transparent 100%
      );
      transform: translateX(-100%);
      transition: transform 0.55s ease;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .about-bento-card:hover::before {
      transform: translateX(100%);
    }
    .about-bento-accent {
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 1rem;
      bottom: 1rem;
      width: 4px;
      border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
      opacity: 0.85;
    }
    .about-bento-icon {
      font-size: 2rem;
      opacity: 0.9;
      margin-left: 0.5rem;
    }
    .about-bento-title {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.3;
      margin-left: 0.5rem;
      color: var(--base-content);
    }
    .about-bento-desc {
      font-size: 0.925rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: hsl(var(--bc) / 0.7);
      margin-left: 0.5rem;
      flex: 1;
    }
  </style>

  <!-- Team Leadership -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-base-200">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-6">

      <!-- Section Header -->
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <span class="badge badge-outline badge-primary uppercase tracking-wide mb-4">Our People</span>
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">Team Leadership</h2>
        <p class="text-xl text-base-content/70 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Meet the students and mentors who drive Team 10989 forward every season.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Student Leadership Divider -->
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-8">
        <div class="flex-1 h-px bg-base-content/10"></div>
        <span class="badge badge-outline badge-primary uppercase tracking-wide text-sm px-4 py-3 whitespace-nowrap">
          <i class="bi bi-star-fill mr-1"></i> Student Leadership
        </span>
        <div class="flex-1 h-px bg-base-content/10"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Student Leadership Grid -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mb-14">

        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-base-100 rounded-xl border border-base-300 hover:border-primary hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <i class="bi bi-award-fill text-primary text-xl"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary mb-0.5">Captain</p>
            <p class="font-bold text-base-content text-lg">Vivaan P.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-base-100 rounded-xl border border-base-300 hover:border-primary hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-secondary/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <i class="bi bi-shield-fill text-secondary text-xl"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary mb-0.5">Vice Captain</p>
            <p class="font-bold text-base-content text-lg">Virat P.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-base-100 rounded-xl border border-base-300 hover:border-primary hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-accent/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <i class="bi bi-briefcase-fill text-accent text-xl"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent mb-0.5">Director of Operations</p>
            <p class="font-bold text-base-content text-lg">Mayon S.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-base-100 rounded-xl border border-base-300 hover:border-primary hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-warning/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <i class="bi bi-tools text-warning text-xl"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-warning mb-0.5">Mechanical Lead</p>
            <p class="font-bold text-base-content text-lg">Lemuel X.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-base-100 rounded-xl border border-base-300 hover:border-primary hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-info/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <i class="bi bi-lightning-charge-fill text-info text-xl"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-info mb-0.5">Electrical Lead</p>
            <p class="font-bold text-base-content text-lg">Anabel S.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-base-100 rounded-xl border border-base-300 hover:border-primary hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-success/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <i class="bi bi-camera-fill text-success text-xl"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-success mb-0.5">Media Lead</p>
            <p class="font-bold text-base-content text-lg">Priyanka P.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-base-100 rounded-xl border border-base-300 hover:border-primary hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-text-fill text-primary text-xl"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-primary mb-0.5">Documentation Lead</p>
            <p class="font-bold text-base-content text-lg">Mayon S.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-base-100 rounded-xl border border-base-300 hover:border-primary hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-secondary/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <i class="bi bi-graph-up-arrow text-secondary text-xl"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-secondary mb-0.5">Strategy Lead</p>
            <p class="font-bold text-base-content text-lg">Vinay G.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-base-100 rounded-xl border border-base-300 hover:border-primary hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-accent/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <i class="bi bi-binoculars-fill text-accent text-xl"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-accent mb-0.5">Scout Lead</p>
            <p class="font-bold text-base-content text-lg">Adarsh M.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-base-100 rounded-xl border border-base-300 hover:border-primary hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-warning/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <i class="bi bi-compass-fill text-warning text-xl"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-warning mb-0.5">Venturing Crew President</p>
            <p class="font-bold text-base-content text-lg">Anabel S.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 p-4 bg-base-100 rounded-xl border border-base-300 hover:border-primary hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-info/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
            <i class="bi bi-compass text-info text-xl"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-info mb-0.5">Venturing Crew Vice President</p>
            <p class="font-bold text-base-content text-lg">Mayon S.</p>
